  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The velocity of the satellite revolving round the Earth at a height&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math>&nbsp;from the centre of the Earth is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac></mfenced></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>The formula to calculate the time period in the circular orbit is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><mi>v</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>In this case:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></math></p><p>Substitute the expression for the velocity from equation (1) into equation (2) and simplify to obtain the required time period.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><msqrt><mfrac><mi>GM</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>R</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msqrt><mi>R</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>32</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></msqrt></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p></blockquote>",
